    about when the file appears at all. It used to claim "any abnormal exit",
    which is false in exactly the case that matters: a `strict=True` refusal is
    an abnormal exit, it correctly gets no marker, and a reader who believed
    that sentence would read the absence of this file as "the take was fine".

